++++++++| B2 `primitives/reduce.ts` | `sumInto(enc, src, count, dst)`（GPU 常驻一等公民）+ `sum(): Promise<number>`（读回糖）。微 pass 清零 → workgroup 树形归约 → atomicAdd |
